    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_725_1#8$1",
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_725_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh* Never imagined we'd get a hot meal indoors safe and sound, after so many days on the run.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "That Bagpipe girl must be the darling of everyone. We were all gushing to her about how good her stew was.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_725_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm, she's definitely not bad on that front.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "How's your discussion on settling down? Has it been smooth?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_725_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We're all decided. Anyone who can't handle rushing'll stay behind. They'll borrow two storehouses to tuck away in for the next two days.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Refugees scuffling with caravans but never actually stealing anything, that's dead common. The law won't get hung up on that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "In a few days, they won't be mentioning it on the radio anymore, and we won't need to hide. Then we can get to building our own houses.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Er, but the few with Oripathy'll be living a bit ways out from the village.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The people here are very friendly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh* Yeah, they are. If anyone sheltered us while we were still running, we wouldn't be in this sty of a state now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not that it's anyone's fault. Didn't used to be much hassle taking in a bunch of refugees or the like, but life's getting scarier for everyone now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look at Selmon, the colleen. If she and her brother had someplace to take them in, she wouldn't be running from settlement to settlement, kicking up all this fuss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She could spend the night in the village like us, but she's all stubborn about hiding outside. Since she stole a man's stockbeast here once, see, and now she's awkward about running into him...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "...*sigh* You never heard it from me. You let her know, she'll be on my case about disrespecting her again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$doorknockquite"
