    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_728_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Good evening...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, Moran? What are you doing here, so dark out? I'll send you back while the lamps are still lit...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_728_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you, but I'm used to making my way in the dark by now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_728_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Is Reed here, if you don't mind?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're looking for her? She went out on her own.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe Reed's got something on her mind... Selmon hasn't spoken so much as a word to her since she got here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, Bagpipe's gone to find her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm... actually, put it this way. Our bigger concern is if Reed gets annoyed by the noise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
