    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Whoa, sorry!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...It's alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, I wasn't watchin' out, didn't think there'd be anyone here. It all goes pitch dark every time they sound the bell. Takes a moment for my eyes to adjust.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lucky it's you I ran into. Might've knocked anyone else clean over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Thought they said they wouldn't need anyone on watch tonight, though?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I just... wanted to sit for a while outside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, it's the smell of the hay, isn't it? Wonderful, that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, that's hay piles over there. Been ages since I was around the smell, so I came out to get a proper whiff of them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Back when I was preppin' to get into military school, I'd have headaches from studyin' so much theory. So I'd just get onto a hay pile and lie back for a bit, and I'd feel right as rain again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mum always told me off for bein' lazy, said I shouldn't quit thinkin' about questions just because thinkin' gets too hard... but havin' too much stuff goin' on in your brain does wear a person out, y'know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Mm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So, give me your hand a sec?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Um...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#9",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Come on, here now, let's lie down together! Just for a bit!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not so good at thinkin' over stuff, so I might not be of much help to you, but the hay will be, I'm sure of it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_hidehaystack",
        "volume": 0.9,
        "delay": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "34_i02",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 2.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hup\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Bagpipe relaxes and lies back on the hay pile, lightly humming a folksong she learned just a while ago from the farmers."
    },
    {
        "text": "A gentle night breeze passes by. Reed follows her suggestion, and takes a deep breath."
    },
    {
        "text": "But what she smells isn't the aroma of hay\u2014it is, instead, damp mud and ash."
    },
    {
        "text": "When it hits me how I've spent three years without goin' home, it always feels so funny.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Think about it. The ground's waitin' for you to till it, the wheat's waitin' for you to reap it... Spend one year away, and you miss an entire go round of all the important stuff, every bit of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't even get my letters from home until the next time I'm back on Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you... miss home very much?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "Course I do. You? Were you from County Hillock?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "...No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I used to live in a city about the same as County Hillock... flushed red bricks, grey pavements. Buildings two or three floors high, flowering vines growing around the windows.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "text": "I... yearn after those peaceful times a lot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "There were so many old books at home, and some manuscripts too. I liked to hide away in the study, and lock the door, so I wouldn't have to hear anyone talk to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, you had piles of family makin' a racket, then? Or was it visitors all the time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "...No, thankfully. Just\u2014I could avoid so much trouble if I hid.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "I could see into the street from the window in there. I'd see my parents come back after a day of work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "I would love to go back there, if I could.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh. So the place isn't...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry... I'm makin' it worse for you, aren't I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's okay. It was all so long ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "I might not be much different\u2014to the ordinary people whose lives were ruined at County Hillock, or to these refugees leaving their home behind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "They can all settle down here, and rebuild their houses... but\u2014where is their homeland?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the ones who are\u2014forced out even farther... where are they fleeing to?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm... You're havin' trouble answerin' these questions just on your lonesome, aren't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I'm not sayin' it's no use thinkin' over them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you can't come up with an answer alone, we can think together. Whenever I had a question I couldn't fill in, I'd always bother Chenchen about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "And later down the line, I'd prattle on at my captains... I mean, they found me annoyin' as flip, but still, they'd chat with me every time, help me solve issues.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about you? You got anyone to speak your mind to? Like a sister or a schoolmate or someone in arms, that sort of...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "There's... my older sister.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't get along much?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "...No. I shouldn't be saying this. I shouldn't...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "Y'know, Selmon was right about one thing, actually. You're always sayin' 'no' out of habit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "But she misunderstood a little. It's when you're talkin' about yourself that you're most fond of sayin' 'no', like... och, I can't put it into words. It's like you're strainin' to break away from somethin'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I've been told something like that before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, what? Really?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "She... saved me, and told me, I didn't have to seek death. That I could dodge destiny.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "Outcast, eh. There's somethin' she would say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "I regret... I regret not having it in me to say anything more to her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to ask her so badly\u2014why save me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "What... did she see in me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ohh. I'm not sure how she'd answer myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, y'know, Reed, why not ask yourself before askin' her? What do you see in yourself?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "My... self?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_hidehaystack",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "delay": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, someone's over there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "With the way they feel about, I think it's Moran... She can't see at night.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Gosh, why's she out here by herself, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Moran! Need any help from us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, you just stand still there for a sec, we'll be right over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "34_g4_swamp_n",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_728_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_728_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where's Reed, can I ask? They said, she'd gone out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1",
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm right here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_728_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Sorry. Excuse me, but am I able to go with you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't mind where it is. I've still got some strength, I can work... and fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "You want to... fight?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_728_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I do. They all say I won't live much longer, that my only option's dying without a word in some corner.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't agree with that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_728_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "'If you want to survive as a Taran, then change workshops, and accept lower pay'. 'If you want to survive as with Oripathy, then move out, and get to the Infected neighborhood'...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm done listening to all that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_728_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reed, I used to not be this way, but then I met you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "text": "They tell me you're an Infected too. It's you who convinced Selmon and the rest to bring us here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... trust me, like Fionn does?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_728_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, no pressure, I... I don't want to be a burden on you, or anyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just want to do something, anything. People like me have nothing left to lose as is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I can bring something or other to the rest of the Tarans, then I want to do it. If my legs will still walk forward, then I want to go with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think that's fine. Reed, for now, let's go together. How about it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "To the red-haired Vouivre, the question's not one Reed needs to respond to, because she starts pulling Reed along before an answer even comes."
    },
    {
        "text": "Reed takes a glance back at their visitor. She knows Moran has night blindness, and needs someone to guide the way when darkness falls."
    },
    {
        "text": "With little time to hesitate, Reed extends a hand to Moran."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Let's go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
