    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_176"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here you finally are, Miss Harmonie. I was beginning to think I'd never see you today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A wine tasting courtesy of the Viscount? How could I ever miss it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_176"
    },
    {
        "text": "But of course, but of course. A friend of the Marquess of Trent! You're the Viscount's guest of honor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's all thanks to your introducing me that I closed out that bit of prior business. I've been looking for an opportunity to thank you all this time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, it was quite nothing, Mr. Hall.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've no noble personage, or even property in my name. At most, I'm just a messenger, scampering around so the ones in charge don't have to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "(Toasts)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#8$1",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 1,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who might he be...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_176"
    },
    {
        "text": "The council's pet. A Mr. Fischer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? Well, I've certainly never heard of him before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_176"
    },
    {
        "text": "He only transferred to this county a short while ago. Youngsters like him tend to have to break their backs a little if they want a quick promotion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heheh. A universal truth, no?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_176"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're too modest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, yes, I hear from some friends that the Dukes' armies are very frequently on the move now. They've put every core city of their duchies under strict martial law.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've always been on top of the news... could you lend me a sly word, whether war seems imminent?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The papers certainly forecast it, don't they? After all, the Dukes' fleets did trundle up to Londinium's walls some while ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_176"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not much concerned with the Sarkaz. I'm referring to between the Dukes... ahem, based on hearsay, that is. Just hearsay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's been a lot of Originium fuel circulating into County Trent. The Marquess and the Duke of Caster have always been jolly with each other, but County Trent and the Iron Duke's duchy share a border...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "My, my, Mr. Hall, all intercity fuel trade requires inspection and approval. I presume you have some <i>very</i> good friends in municipal management, no?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_176"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha... haha, just for business purposes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Harmonie, you might not follow the war too closely, but... you came in from another city, didn't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been fortunate not to run into any hassle when you did, but I do ask you take care on the return journey.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hear it's hideous in the villages beyond the nomadic cities. There's rebel elements popping up now and then. Even a case of arson a few days ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "What sort of rebel elements are these to earn your attention?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_176"
    },
    {
        "text": "Attention is a strong word\u2014similar things happen in spades anywhere the bumpkins live.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's that fire that's strange... hahah. This might not be true, so pretend I'm just telling you about some country tale.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eyewitnesses say that fire wasn't quite your ordinary one. It was ferocious as an explosion, but not a hint of Originium explosives was found where it happened. And the nightmarish effort it took to extinguish it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
