    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Sir, I assume you've seen the relevant dossier, as well as all my reports.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "text": "I suggest we commence operation immediately...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Very well done, youngster. Have you tried the whiskey-filled chocolates out on the table?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Screened Woman's Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope you're well, Duke of Caster. I didn't expect you would grace this party, let alone be waiting here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
