    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Who could miss such a grand soir\u00e9e? Just listening to the chamber performance blows my cares away, even from behind my partition.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "I do hope you're enjoying yourself too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm... still on duty. I can't be complacent.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our every effort is made so that the masses can enjoy their serene lives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Intelligence officers may be the lookouts, forced to keep a tense nerve even in times of peace, but you'll have your serenity one day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lest I forget. How's your health?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "My gratitude for your concern, Duke. It floors me that you note the infection of an average intelligence officer like myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "text": "I\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't be nervous. You're not hiding anything. As I say, you've done very well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "By way of a reward, would you like a promotion after your mission is over, or would you like to quit?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
